cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "AUTHOR_METADATA_PENDING_BEFORE_PUBLIC_DEPOSIT - the author list, ORCIDs and affiliations must be completed before this package is deposited publicly."
title: "Directional reproducibility of urban morphology relationships across analytical settings"
abstract: >-
  Self-contained journal reproducibility package for the WP-MORPH constrained
  exploration-validation analysis of three pairwise urban morphology
  relationships (building coverage, road density, conditional building height)
  across two spatial scales, two window selections and two correlation
  formulations. The package reproduces the manuscript-level numerical results
  and figures from frozen inputs and does not execute or authorize the formal
  CANU production pipeline.
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - urban morphology
  - reproducibility
  - exploration-validation
  - spatial scale sensitivity
  - modifiable areal unit problem
  - building coverage
  - road density
  - building height
date-released: "2026-09-28"
authors:
  - name: "AUTHOR_METADATA_PENDING_BEFORE_PUBLIC_DEPOSIT"
    # Do not invent author names. Replace this entry with the manuscript author
    # list (family-names, given-names, ORCID, affiliation) before deposit.
notes:
  - "AUTHOR_METADATA_PENDING_BEFORE_PUBLIC_DEPOSIT: the authoritative author list is the one on the associated manuscript."
  - "repository-code is intentionally omitted: no public repository URL has been assigned yet."
  - "The licence of the derived analytical data is recorded as FINAL_DERIVED_DATA_LICENCE = PENDING_AUTHOR_CONFIRMATION in LICENSE.md and must be stated before public deposit."
  - "Companion artefacts: README.md, REPRODUCIBILITY.md, DATA_DICTIONARY.md, METHODS_MAPPING.md, DETERMINISM_VERIFICATION.md, LICENSE.md."
